Cross	A
Circle	B
Square	X
Triangle	Y
L1	LB
R1	RB
L2	LT
R2	RT
L3	LS
R3	RS
Options	Menu

Use one normalized internal representation for equivalent physical buttons so character profiles work consistently across both supported controller families.

If a PlayStation controller is being used, the interface should show PlayStation button names.

If an Xbox controller is being used, show Xbox button names.

Do not require players to mentally translate one controller’s labels into another.

