PART 14 — FUTURE CHARACTER SUPPORT

This controller system must scale to ALVA’s future roster.

ALVA currently has two playable characters, but its roster is designed for many more.

Never build the system assuming there will only be #0001 and #0002.

14.1 Character definitions as the source of truth

